{"seq":2,"slug":"location-node-channel-hierarchy","title":"库存位置与渠道节点层级建模：仓/门店/在途/虚拟位置的聚合关系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/omnichannel-inventory-visibility-platform/unified-inventory-data-model/location-node-channel-hierarchy","wordCount":2565,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"库存位置与渠道节点层级建模-仓-门店-在途-虚拟位置的聚合关系\">库存位置与渠道节点层级建模：仓/门店/在途/虚拟位置的聚合关系</h1><p>一家跨境电商在 2026 年遇到的第一个真实问题，往往不是&quot;库存够不够&quot;，而是&quot;这批货到底算在哪个位置上&quot;。同一个 SKU 可能同时躺在洛杉矶 3PL 的货架上、在深圳飞往洛杉矶的航班上、在悉尼门店的库房里、以及一个根本不存在实体的&quot;预售池&quot;里。要让下游的可用量承诺（ATP）给出一个数字，平台必须先回答：位置是什么、位置如何分层、渠道如何映射到位置。本文只讨论这一层建模——它是&quot;全渠道库存可见性&quot;整座建筑的地基，地基错了，上面所有实时聚合都是精确的错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-位置是-可承诺库存的最小寻址单元\">核心概念：位置是&quot;可承诺库存的最小寻址单元&quot;</h2><p>在库存系统里，<strong>位置（location）不是仓库的同义词</strong>。仓库是一个物理建筑，而位置是一个<strong>可寻址的、可以在其上挂载库存余额并对外做出承诺的节点</strong>。一个外部系统若要知道&quot;我能不能从这里发货&quot;，它需要的寻址粒度是位置，而不是建筑。</p>\n<p>工业界为此沉淀了成熟的外部标识。GS1 通用规范定义的 <strong>GLN（Global Location Number，全球位置码）</strong> 是一个 13 位标识，前缀来自 GS1 公司前缀，可唯一标识法律实体、功能实体和物理位置（来源：GS1 General Specifications）。GS1 的 <strong>EPCIS 2.0</strong>（2022 年 6 月获批）在事件模型中把&quot;事件发生地点&quot;拆成 <code>readPoint</code>（读取点，如某台扫码设备）与 <code>bizLocation</code>（业务位置，如某仓位），这是&quot;一个位置内部还有子位置&quot;的外部权威依据（来源：GS1 EPCIS 2.0 Standard）。</p>\n<p>认清这一点后，位置建模要区分三类节点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>物理位置</strong>：有经纬度、有营业时间、能实际拣货发货的地点（仓库、门店、前置仓）。</li>\n<li><strong>逻辑位置</strong>：不占地但代表一段可承诺的货权或物理位置内部的分区（库区、货架位、寄售库存）。</li>\n<li><strong>虚拟位置</strong>：无实体承载，靠供应侧规则支撑承诺（预售池、代发供应商、跨仓调拨缓冲池）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>在途（in-transit）是最容易被误建模的一类</strong>。它不是&quot;某个仓库的负数&quot;，而应建模为一个<strong>独立的、有时效的位置节点</strong>，货权已从起点转出、尚未落入终点。把它挂到起点会造成超卖，挂到终点会造成虚假可用，只有独立成节点并带时间窗口，才能让聚合层正确处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"位置节点类型学-仓-门店-在途-虚拟\">位置节点类型学：仓、门店、在途、虚拟</h2><p>下表把跨境电商常见的节点类型、典型寻址标识与&quot;是否可直接承诺&quot;对齐，这张表就是数据模型里 <code>location.type</code> 的取值域来源。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>节点类型</th>\n<th>承载形态</th>\n<th>典型外部标识</th>\n<th>可承诺性</th>\n<th>关键属性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>履约中心 FC / 海外仓</td>\n<td>物理</td>\n<td>GLN / 内部 location_id</td>\n<td>直接可承诺</td>\n<td>时区、截单时间、承运商、可发国家</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前置仓 / 暗店</td>\n<td>物理</td>\n<td>GLN / 内部 location_id</td>\n<td>直接可承诺（限半径）</td>\n<td>服务半径、配送时段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>门店</td>\n<td>物理</td>\n<td>GLN / 门店编码</td>\n<td>可承诺（含店内自提）</td>\n<td>营业时间、店内库存可售比例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3PL / 代发供应商</td>\n<td>物理（第三方）</td>\n<td>供应商 ID + 仓库码</td>\n<td>间接（需回执）</td>\n<td>回传频率、SLA、对账周期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在途-入库</td>\n<td>逻辑（时效）</td>\n<td>运单号 / ASN</td>\n<td>按时效承诺</td>\n<td>预计到达、承运商、清关状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在途-调拨</td>\n<td>逻辑（时效）</td>\n<td>调拨单号</td>\n<td>按时效承诺</td>\n<td>起终点、在途天数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>寄售 / 客退暂存</td>\n<td>逻辑</td>\n<td>内部 sub-location</td>\n<td>通常不可承诺</td>\n<td>货权方、质检状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预售池 / 虚拟池</td>\n<td>虚拟</td>\n<td>内部 pool_id</td>\n<td>规则可承诺</td>\n<td>缺口阈值、补货触发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨仓共享池</td>\n<td>虚拟</td>\n<td>内部 pool_id</td>\n<td>规则可承诺</td>\n<td>成员位置集合、分配策略</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个容易忽略的事实：Google Merchant Center 的&quot;本地库存广告&quot;（Local Inventory Ads）要求商家为每个实体店提供<strong>门店编码（store code）</strong> 与独立的本地库存 feed，才能让广告展示&quot;附近有货&quot;（来源：Google Merchant Center 本地库存帮助文档）。这意味着门店作为位置的建模质量，会直接决定跨境商家在搜索侧的转化，而不只是影响内部履约。</p>\n<h2 id=\"层级建模-从位置到可承诺库存的聚合路径\">层级建模：从位置到可承诺库存的聚合路径</h2><p>位置不是平铺的一张表，而是<strong>两棵彼此独立的树</strong>，这一点是初学者最常犯的结构错误：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>物理层级</strong>：企业 → 区域 → 位置 → 子位置（库区/货架）。它回答&quot;货在哪里&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>渠道层级</strong>：渠道 → 渠道节点 → 可服务的位置集合。它回答&quot;这个渠道能从哪些位置卖&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>两棵树通过<strong>位置-渠道映射</strong>（多对多）相连。硬把渠道塞进物理树（例如&quot;美国区-线上仓&quot;）会在跨境场景下立即崩溃，因为同一个仓位往往同时服务独立站、平台店和线下门店。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[企业 Enterprise] --&gt; B[区域 Region&lt;br/&gt;NA / EU / APAC]&#10;  B --&gt; C1[履约中心 FC-LAX]&#10;  B --&gt; C2[门店门店 SYD-01]&#10;  B --&gt; C3[在途 ASN-7781&lt;br/&gt;时效位置]&#10;  C1 --&gt; D1[子位置 库区A&lt;br/&gt;可拣货]&#10;  C1 --&gt; D2[子位置 质检暂存&lt;br/&gt;不可承诺]&#10;  C2 --&gt; D3[子位置 卖场货架]&#10;  C2 --&gt; D4[子位置 后仓]&#10;  E[渠道 DTC 独立站] --&gt; F1[渠道节点 US-DTC]&#10;  E --&gt; F2[渠道节点 AU-DTC]&#10;  F1 --&gt; G[可服务位置集合&lt;br/&gt;FC-LAX / 3PL-SFO / 预售池]&#10;  F2 --&gt; G2[可服务位置集合&lt;br/&gt;SYD-01 / 在途 ASN-7781]&#10;  C1 -.-&gt; G&#10;  C2 -.-&gt; G2&#10;  C3 -.-&gt; G2\">graph TD\n  A[企业 Enterprise] --&gt; B[区域 Region&lt;br/&gt;NA / EU / APAC]\n  B --&gt; C1[履约中心 FC-LAX]\n  B --&gt; C2[门店门店 SYD-01]\n  B --&gt; C3[在途 ASN-7781&lt;br/&gt;时效位置]\n  C1 --&gt; D1[子位置 库区A&lt;br/&gt;可拣货]\n  C1 --&gt; D2[子位置 质检暂存&lt;br/&gt;不可承诺]\n  C2 --&gt; D3[子位置 卖场货架]\n  C2 --&gt; D4[子位置 后仓]\n  E[渠道 DTC 独立站] --&gt; F1[渠道节点 US-DTC]\n  E --&gt; F2[渠道节点 AU-DTC]\n  F1 --&gt; G[可服务位置集合&lt;br/&gt;FC-LAX / 3PL-SFO / 预售池]\n  F2 --&gt; G2[可服务位置集合&lt;br/&gt;SYD-01 / 在途 ASN-7781]\n  C1 -.-&gt; G\n  C2 -.-&gt; G2\n  C3 -.-&gt; G2</pre><p>聚合到&quot;可承诺量&quot;时，节点自身的余额要经过层层过滤。设位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span> 上 SKU <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 的物理库存为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{l,s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，被占用/预留量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{l,s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，不可承诺比例（质检、样品、安全库存）为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则该位置的<strong>可承诺量</strong>为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ATP_{l,s} = \\max\\left(0,\\; Q_{l,s} - R_{l,s} - \\lfloor \\theta_l \\cdot Q_{l,s} \\rfloor\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>渠道节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 的可承诺量是其可服务位置集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的聚合，但要先应用<strong>渠道级上限</strong>（跨位置共享时的分配约束）<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>cap</mtext><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cap}_{c,l}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8108em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cap</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow></munder><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mtext>cap</mtext><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ATP_{c,s} = \\min\\left(\\sum_{l \\in L_c} \\min\\left(ATP_{l,s},\\; \\text{cap}_{c,l}\\right),\\; \\; C_{c,s}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1522em;vertical-align:-1.4022em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4022em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cap</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{c,s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该渠道节点的总配额。<strong>如果对同一批在途库存同时出现在两个渠道的位置集合里，这里就会重复计数</strong> —— 这是下面&quot;不变式&quot;一节要专门处理的陷阱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"渠道与位置的映射-多对多关系与其代价\">渠道与位置的映射：多对多关系与其代价</h2><p>映射表看起来只是一张 <code>channel_id × location_id</code> 的关联表，但它是整个平台最贵的一张表：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>一个渠道映射到多个位置</strong>：独立站需要&quot;就近发货&quot;，于是同时挂上多个海外仓与 3PL，聚合时按优先级或成本排序。</li>\n<li><strong>一个位置映射到多个渠道</strong>：同一个美国仓同时服务独立站、平台店和线下 BOPIS（线上买线下取），必须为每个渠道设不同配额，否则高优先渠道会吃光库存。</li>\n<li><strong>在途位置通常只映射到&quot;目标区域&quot;的渠道</strong>，不映射到起点渠道，否则起点会以为货还在。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>建模上，映射边至少需要携带四个字段：<code>channel_id</code>、<code>location_id</code>、<code>priority</code>（聚合排序权重）、<code>cap</code>（该渠道在该位置的分配上限）。把 <code>cap</code> 省掉是最常见的偷懒，代价是旺季时两个渠道把同一批货各卖了一遍。</p>\n<p>另一条纪律：<strong>对外承诺的地址标识必须与内部 location_id 解耦</strong>。外部渠道（平台、比价、广告）使用 GLN 或平台自定义门店码，内部聚合使用稳定的 location_id，中间经由一张映射表转换。这样更换 3PL 或迁移仓库时，只改映射，不动历史余额。</p>\n<h2 id=\"建模陷阱与不变式\">建模陷阱与不变式</h2><p><strong>陷阱一：在途重复计数。</strong> 当&quot;在途-入库&quot;节点 F 预计到达位置 L，若 F 已挂在 L 的可服务集合里、同时 L 自己又有一条&quot;在途到货预期&quot;记录，聚合时同一批货被算了两次。不变式：<strong>每一批在途库存，在同一时刻只能属于一个节点</strong>，且该节点的 <code>effective_window</code> 必须覆盖当前时刻。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱二：时间维度被扁平化。</strong> 位置是<strong>时效对象</strong>。在途位置只在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[t_{depart}, t_{arrive}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 内有意义，过了到达时间应自动转为终点的余额，若不转移就会永久滞留为幽灵库存。建模上每个余额记录都应带 <code>valid_from</code> / <code>valid_to</code>，并遵循 ISO 8601 时间表示（来源：ISO 8601）。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱三：子位置粒度上卷不一致。</strong> 若父位置有余额、子位置也有余额，聚合时按两者之和计算会翻倍。不变式：<strong>同一棵物理树中，余额只挂在叶节点或只挂在聚合节点，二者取一</strong>，跨层聚合由查询时计算而非存储时累加。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱四：虚拟位置被当作物理位置承诺时效。</strong> 预售池没有承运商、没有截单时间，若下游 ATP 直接拿它算&quot;两日达&quot;，就会系统性超时。不变式：虚拟位置必须显式声明 <code>fulfillment_class = virtual</code>，下游任何时效计算遇到该类节点必须回退到&quot;需人工/供应商确认&quot;。</p>\n<p>把这些不变式写成校验规则（可在 CI 中对库存快照跑），比事后对账便宜得多。GS1 的 EPCIS 之所以把 <code>readPoint</code> 与 <code>bizLocation</code> 分开，本质上就是防止&quot;设备位置&quot;污染&quot;业务位置&quot;的语义——同一条纪律在内部数据模型里同样成立。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>位置建模的核心判断只有一句话：<strong>位置是可承诺库存的寻址单元，而非仓库的别名</strong>。以此为起点，本层要交付三件事——一张区分物理/逻辑/虚拟的节点类型表（含在途独立成节点）、一棵与渠道树解耦的物理层级树、一张携带 <code>priority</code> 与 <code>cap</code> 的多对多位置-渠道映射。落地时守住四条不变式：在途库存同一时刻只属一个节点、每个余额带有效时间窗口、同树内余额分层不重复、虚拟位置不伪装时效。</p>\n<p>只有当地基层稳定，后续的实时聚合与对外承诺才是&quot;精确的正确&quot;，而不是&quot;精确的错误&quot;。当你在下一层看到&quot;可用量抖动&quot;或&quot;两渠道超卖&quot;时，绝大多数根因都会回溯到本文的某个不变式被破坏，而非聚合算法本身。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"库存位置与渠道节点层级建模：仓/门店/在途/虚拟位置的聚合关系","id":"库存位置与渠道节点层级建模-仓-门店-在途-虚拟位置的聚合关系"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：位置是\"可承诺库存的最小寻址单元\"","id":"核心概念-位置是-可承诺库存的最小寻址单元"},{"level":2,"text":"位置节点类型学：仓、门店、在途、虚拟","id":"位置节点类型学-仓-门店-在途-虚拟"},{"level":2,"text":"层级建模：从位置到可承诺库存的聚合路径","id":"层级建模-从位置到可承诺库存的聚合路径"},{"level":2,"text":"渠道与位置的映射：多对多关系与其代价","id":"渠道与位置的映射-多对多关系与其代价"},{"level":2,"text":"建模陷阱与不变式","id":"建模陷阱与不变式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"库存可用量与状态分类模型：on-hand/ATP/预留/安全库存/在途的统一语义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/omnichannel-inventory-visibility-platform/unified-inventory-data-model/inventory-availability-state-taxonomy"},"next":{"title":"商品标识映射实践：SKU/组合装/序列号单元与跨系统映射对账异常","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/omnichannel-inventory-visibility-platform/unified-inventory-data-model/inventory-identity-bundle-serial-mapping"}}